        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "verse",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "立笔下，直斗直，要认它脉上微微的脉气。饶中借字实为真法，凑煞安坟则人绝迹。",
        "confidence": "high",
