        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "verse",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "燕子尾，实难言，穴如鱼尾一同安葬。势来直急宜斜剪，切忌流神坐下牵。",
        "confidence": "high",
